cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "sqf-lab: Symmetric Quartet Folding laboratory for secp256k1"
message: "If you use this software or the benchmark methodology, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "akoffice933-maker"
    alias: "akoffice933-maker"
