license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/akoffice933-maker/sqf-lab"
keywords:
  - secp256k1
  - elliptic curve discrete logarithm
  - Pollard kangaroo
  - baby-step giant-step
  - reproducible benchmarks
abstract: >
  Reference implementation and honest benchmark harness for symmetric-quartet
  baby-step/giant-step search on secp256k1, plus a persistent anti-duplicate
  scan registry, a multi-herd kangaroo baseline, puzzle reconstruction notes
  and a fixed schema for reporting measured constants.
